{"name":"Beauty and the Beach","hex":"#c99680","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"beauty","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The quality of being (especially visually) attractive, pleasing, fine or good-looking; comeliness.","Someone who is beautiful."]},{"part":"Interjection","definitions":["Thanks!","Cool!"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/beauty"},{"term":"and","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Symbol","definitions":["ISO 639-3 language code for Ansus."]},{"part":"Conjunction","definitions":["As a coordinating conjunction; expressing two elements to be taken together or in addition to each other.\nUsed simply to connect two noun phrases, adjectives or adverbs. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}\n\nSimply connecting two clauses or sentences. \n\nIntroducing a clause or sentence which follows on in time or consequence from the first.","Used simply to connect two noun phrases, adjectives or adverbs. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/and"},{"term":"beach","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The shore of a body of water, especially when sandy or pebbly.","A horizontal strip of land, usually sandy, adjoining water."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To run aground on a beach.","To run (something) aground on a beach."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/beach"}],"entries":[{"title":"Beauty and the Beach","blocks":[{"text":"Beauty and the Beach is a 1941 American short musical film directed by Leslie M. Roush. It was nominated for an Academy Award at the 14th Academy Awards for Best Short Subject (One-Reel)."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beauty_and_the_Beach"},{"title":"Pokémon episodes removed from rotation","blocks":[{"text":"Pokémon is an anime television series that originally debuted in Japan on April 1, 1997. Throughout its run of over 1,300 episodes, specific episodes have been pulled from airing, banned from airing in certain countries, or never aired at all."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/International_Pok%C3%A9mon_logo.svg/330px-International_Pok%C3%A9mon_logo.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pok%C3%A9mon_episodes_removed_from_rotation"},{"title":"Beauty","blocks":[{"text":"Beauty is commonly described as a feature of objects that makes them pleasurable to perceive. Such objects include landscapes, sunsets, humans and works of art. Beauty, art and taste are the main subjects of aesthetics, one of the fields of study within philosophy. As a positive aesthetic value, it is contrasted with ugliness as its negative counterpart."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Rozeta_Pary%C5%BC_notre-dame_chalger.jpg/330px-Rozeta_Pary%C5%BC_notre-dame_chalger.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beauty"},{"title":"Beach","blocks":[{"text":"A beach is a landform alongside a body of water which consists of loose particles. The particles composing a beach are typically made from rock, such as sand, gravel, shingle, pebbles, etc., or biological sources, such as mollusc shells or coralline algae. Sediments settle in different densities and structures, depending on the local wave action and weather, creating different textures, colors and gradients or layers of material."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/73/Beach_at_Fort_Lauderdale.jpg/330px-Beach_at_Fort_Lauderdale.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beach"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/13/Denno_Senshi_Porygon_Seizure.gif/330px-Denno_Senshi_Porygon_Seizure.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/13/Denno_Senshi_Porygon_Seizure.gif/330px-Denno_Senshi_Porygon_Seizure.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A slowed-down version of the effect that caused epileptic seizures among the viewers of the episode.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADenno_Senshi_Porygon_Seizure.gif"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/53/Pok%C3%A9mon_Jynx_%28black%29_art.gif/250px-Pok%C3%A9mon_Jynx_%28black%29_art.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/53/Pok%C3%A9mon_Jynx_%28black%29_art.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/53/Pok%C3%A9mon_Jynx_%28black%29_art.gif/250px-Pok%C3%A9mon_Jynx_%28black%29_art.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Official artwork of Jynx's old design. Jynx's resemblance to negative racial stereotypes resulted in several episodes being removed from airing.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APok%C3%A9mon_Jynx_(black)_art.gif"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d9/Pokemon-James-Blowup.gif/330px-Pokemon-James-Blowup.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d9/Pokemon-James-Blowup.gif/330px-Pokemon-James-Blowup.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Scene from the episode \"Beauty and the Beach\" when James shows off his inflatable breasts, offending Misty.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APokemon-James-Blowup.gif"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/Colt_Autentica.jpg/500px-Colt_Autentica.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c